# 🎯 Interview Tip (30–50 LPA)

A strong answer should not stop at definitions. Relate Git to real-world usage, for example:

- Version control
- Team collaboration
- CI/CD automation
- Infrastructure as Code (IaC)
- Code review
- Rollback and recovery
- Audit history
- Secure software development

This demonstrates that you understand **how Git is used in production environments**, not just its commands.
